   Romualdas and Luksaite, Vaida and Binkyte-Veliene, Arune and Vetloviene,
   Ingrida and Kaklauskiene, Loreta},
Title = {A Review of AI Cloud and Edge Sensors, Methods, and Applications for the
   Recognition of Emotional, Affective and Physiological States},
